<% if @scope == :subdomain %>
# Your account on this subdomain is scheduled for deletion

Your account on **<%= @subdomain %>** will be permanently deleted on **<%= @scrub_date.to_date.to_fs(:long) %>**. Until then, you can restore it. Your accounts on other subdomains are not affected.

- On the deletion date, your profile on this subdomain is anonymized and your access here is permanently removed. Content you shared stays, attributed to "Deleted User".
- Your API tokens on this subdomain were revoked when you requested deletion. After restoring, issue new tokens if you need them.
- Restoring re-enables your automations and your agents on this subdomain.
- Your login, prepaid balance, and other subdomains are untouched.
<% else %>
# Your account is scheduled for deletion

It will be permanently deleted on **<%= @scrub_date.to_date.to_fs(:long) %>**. Until then, you can restore it.

- On the deletion date, your profile is anonymized and your access is permanently removed. Content you shared stays, attributed to "Deleted User".
- If you have a prepaid balance, it is forfeited on the deletion date — not before.
- Your API tokens were revoked and your plan subscription was cancelled when you requested deletion. After restoring, issue new tokens and restart the subscription if you want paid features.
- Restoring re-enables your automations and your agents.
<% end %>

To restore: POST to `/account/deletion/restore`.
